window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I escaped Lowsky's clutches but now I'm separated from my fated mates as the country's defenses crumble and far dark forces work to seize control.</p> <p>Fate has spoken and I can no longer fight the inevitable pull towards the men destined to be mine. I'm desperate to find them – to know they're safe – to hold them in my arms.</p> <p>But I'm not the only one searching. Tales of my existence – of my powers – mean once again I'm on the run. Only this time I don't know who I'm running from.</p> <p>Can I find my mates before my enemies find me?</p> <p>***</p> <p>A new why choose romantasy series with magic, romance, ruthless love interests and fated mates. Burdened Bonds is the fourth and penultimate book in the Arrow Hart Academy series. The story will not complete in this book and contains some scenes that listeners may find challenging.</p>"; 
